{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Erstelle eine vollständig responsive, iconbasierte Content-Section im gleichen einheitlichen Seitenraster wie die restliche Über-uns-Seite. Wichtig: Die Section darf nicht ihre eigene abweichende Breite bekommen. Sie muss sich exakt an derselben maximalen Content-Breite und denselben linken/rechten Seitenabständen wie die anderen Sections ausrichten.
    
    Desktop: Zweispaltiges Layout. Links befindet sich der Textbereich mit einer kleinen Eyebrow „UNSERE STÄRKE“, darunter eine große, fette Überschrift und anschließend ein Fließtext. Rechts befinden sich 3 Informationsblöcke nebeneinander oder gleichmäßig innerhalb der rechten Hälfte verteilt. Jeder Informationsblock besteht aus einem frei auswählbaren Icon, einer Überschrift und einem kurzen Beschreibungstext. Zwischen den Informationsblöcken befinden sich feine vertikale Trennlinien, aber keine Karten, Rahmen oder Boxen.
    
    Mobile: Alles wird untereinander angeordnet. Zuerst Eyebrow, Überschrift und Fließtext. Darunter folgen die drei Informationsblöcke vertikal untereinander. Jeder Block besteht aus Icon links und Text rechts. Zwischen den Blöcken befinden sich dezente horizontale Trennlinien. Die Icons sollen in einem dezenten runden Hintergrund dargestellt werden können.
    
    Im Shopify-Editor muss alles anpassbar sein: maximale Section-/Content-Breite, Section-Mindesthöhe, Section-Hintergrundfarbe, Seitenabstand Desktop, Seitenabstand Tablet, Seitenabstand Mobile, Padding oben/unten Desktop und Mobile, Spaltenverhältnis Desktop, Abstand zwischen den Spalten, Eyebrow-Text/-Farbe/-Größe, Überschrift/-Farbe/-Größe Desktop und Mobile, Fließtext/-Farbe/-Größe Desktop und Mobile sowie Zeilenhöhe.
    
    Die 3 Informationsblöcke müssen als Shopify-Blöcke angelegt werden, damit ich jeden einzeln bearbeiten kann. Pro Block möchte ich Icon/Bild selbst hochladen bzw. auswählen, Überschrift und Beschreibung ändern sowie Icon-Größe, Icon-Hintergrundfarbe und Textfarben einstellen können. Die Größe der Icons muss für Desktop und Mobile separat einstellbar sein.
    
    Auch Farbe, Stärke und Abstand der Trennlinien müssen einstellbar sein. Es darf keine äußere Umrandung um die Informationsblöcke geben.
    
    Die Section muss auf Desktop, Tablet und Mobile vollständig responsiv sein. Keine starren Pixelbreiten verwenden, die zu Überläufen führen. Auf kleineren Displays müssen Schriftgrößen, Abstände und Elemente sinnvoll skalieren.
    
    Besonders wichtig: Auf Mobile müssen Textbereich, Informationsblöcke und alle anderen Inhalte exakt dieselbe verfügbare Breite nutzen. Die eingestellten mobilen Seitenabstände gelten für die gesamte Section, nicht für einzelne Elemente. Dadurch muss diese Section links und rechts exakt auf derselben Linie wie alle anderen Sections der Seite abschließen.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
.ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:100%;background:{{ block.settings.background_color }};min-height:{{ block.settings.min_height }}px}.ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{width:min({{ block.settings.content_width }}px,100%);margin:0 auto;padding:{{ block.settings.padding_desktop }}px {{ block.settings.desktop_gutter }}px;box-sizing:border-box}.ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,{{ block.settings.text_ratio }}fr) minmax(0,{{ block.settings.feature_ratio }}fr);gap:{{ block.settings.column_gap }}px;align-items:center}.ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow{margin:0 0 14px;color:{{ block.settings.eyebrow_color }};font-size:{{ block.settings.eyebrow_size }}px;letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:700}.ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title{margin:0 0 18px;color:{{ block.settings.title_color }};font-family:{{ block.settings.heading_font.family }};font-size:{{ block.settings.title_size_desktop }}px;line-height:1.1}.ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copy{margin:0;color:{{ block.settings.copy_color }};font-family:{{ block.settings.body_font.family }};font-size:{{ block.settings.copy_size_desktop }}px;line-height:{{ block.settings.copy_line_height }}}.ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__features{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}.ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature{min-width:0;padding:0 24px}.ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature+.ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature{border-left:{{ block.settings.divider_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.divider_color }}}.ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon{width:{{ block.settings.icon_size_desktop }}px;height:{{ block.settings.icon_size_desktop }}px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--icon-bg);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:18px;overflow:hidden}.ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain}.ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon svg{width:55%;height:55%;color:{{ block.settings.icon_fallback_color }}}.ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature-title{margin:0 0 8px;color:var(--title-color);font-family:{{ block.settings.heading_font.family }};font-size:{{ block.settings.feature_title_size }}px}.ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature-copy{margin:0;color:var(--copy-color);font-family:{{ block.settings.body_font.family }};font-size:{{ block.settings.feature_copy_size }}px;line-height:1.5}@media(max-width:990px){.ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{padding-left:{{ block.settings.tablet_gutter }}px;padding-right:{{ block.settings.tablet_gutter }}px}.ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__layout{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:42px}}@media(max-width:749px){.ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{padding:{{ block.settings.padding_mobile }}px {{ block.settings.mobile_gutter }}px}.ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title{font-size:{{ block.settings.title_size_mobile }}px}.ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copy{font-size:{{ block.settings.copy_size_mobile }}px}.ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__features{display:block}.ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature{display:grid;grid-template-columns:{{ block.settings.icon_size_mobile }}px minmax(0,1fr);gap:16px;padding:20px 0}.ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature+.ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature{border-left:0;border-top:{{ block.settings.divider_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.divider_color }}}.ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon{width:{{ block.settings.icon_size_mobile }}px;height:{{ block.settings.icon_size_mobile }}px;margin:0}}
{% endstyle %}
<div class="ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><div class="ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner"><div class="ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__layout"><div><p class="ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow">{{ block.settings.eyebrow }}</p><h2 class="ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title">{{ block.settings.title }}</h2><div class="ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copy">{{ block.settings.copy }}</div></div><div class="ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__features">{% for i in (1..3) %}{% assign image_key='icon_'|append:i %}{% assign title_key='feature_title_'|append:i %}{% assign copy_key='feature_copy_'|append:i %}{% assign bg_key='icon_bg_'|append:i %}{% assign tc_key='feature_title_color_'|append:i %}{% assign cc_key='feature_copy_color_'|append:i %}<div class="ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature" style="--icon-bg:{{ block.settings[bg_key] }};--title-color:{{ block.settings[tc_key] }};--copy-color:{{ block.settings[cc_key] }}"><div class="ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon">{% if block.settings[image_key] %}<img src="{{ block.settings[image_key] | image_url: width:160 }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{% else %}{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}{% endif %}</div><div><h3 class="ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature-title">{{ block.settings[title_key] }}</h3><p class="ai-strength-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature-copy">{{ block.settings[copy_key] }}</p></div></div>{% endfor %}</div></div></div></div>
{% schema %}{"name":"Icon strengths","settings":[{"type":"range","id":"content_width","label":"Content width","min":1000,"max":1800,"step":50,"unit":"px","default":1500},{"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},{"type":"range","id":"min_height","label":"Minimum height","min":200,"max":900,"step":20,"unit":"px","default":420},{"type":"range","id":"desktop_gutter","label":"Desktop side spacing","min":0,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":20},{"type":"range","id":"tablet_gutter","label":"Tablet side spacing","min":0,"max":80,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":25},{"type":"range","id":"mobile_gutter","label":"Mobile side spacing","min":0,"max":50,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":20},{"type":"range","id":"padding_desktop","label":"Desktop vertical padding","min":0,"max":160,"step":10,"unit":"px","default":80},{"type":"range","id":"padding_mobile","label":"Mobile vertical padding","min":0,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":50},{"type":"range","id":"text_ratio","label":"Text column ratio","min":1,"max":5,"step":1,"default":2},{"type":"range","id":"feature_ratio","label":"Feature column ratio","min":1,"max":5,"step":1,"default":3},{"type":"range","id":"column_gap","label":"Column gap","min":20,"max":160,"step":10,"unit":"px","default":80},{"type":"color","id":"background_color","label":"Background","default":"#ffffff"},{"type":"text","id":"eyebrow","label":"Eyebrow","default":"UNSERE STÄRKE"},{"type":"color","id":"eyebrow_color","label":"Eyebrow color","default":"#1d2e40"},{"type":"range","id":"eyebrow_size","label":"Eyebrow size","min":10,"max":24,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":12},{"type":"text","id":"title","label":"Heading","default":"Kompetenz, auf die Sie zählen können"},{"type":"color","id":"title_color","label":"Heading color","default":"#1d2e40"},{"type":"range","id":"title_size_desktop","label":"Heading size desktop","min":28,"max":72,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":48},{"type":"range","id":"title_size_mobile","label":"Heading size mobile","min":24,"max":48,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":34},{"type":"textarea","id":"copy","label":"Text","default":"Wir verbinden medizinische Expertise mit zuverlässigem Service und hochwertigen Lösungen für den professionellen Alltag."},{"type":"color","id":"copy_color","label":"Text color","default":"#44515f"},{"type":"range","id":"copy_size_desktop","label":"Text size desktop","min":14,"max":24,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":17},{"type":"range","id":"copy_size_mobile","label":"Text size mobile","min":14,"max":22,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":16},{"type":"range","id":"copy_line_height","label":"Line height","min":1,"max":2,"step":0.1,"default":1.6},{"type":"font_picker","id":"heading_font","label":"Heading font","default":"poppins_n4"},{"type":"font_picker","id":"body_font","label":"Body font","default":"manrope_n4"},{"type":"range","id":"icon_size_desktop","label":"Icon size desktop","min":32,"max":100,"step":4,"unit":"px","default":56},{"type":"range","id":"icon_size_mobile","label":"Icon size mobile","min":28,"max":80,"step":4,"unit":"px","default":48},{"type":"color","id":"icon_fallback_color","label":"Icon fallback color","default":"#1d2e40"},{"type":"range","id":"feature_title_size","label":"Feature heading size","min":14,"max":28,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":18},{"type":"range","id":"feature_copy_size","label":"Feature text size","min":12,"max":20,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":14},{"type":"color","id":"divider_color","label":"Divider color","default":"#d8e0e5"},{"type":"range","id":"divider_width","label":"Divider width","min":1,"max":4,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":1},{"type":"image_picker","id":"icon_1","label":"Icon 1"},{"type":"text","id":"feature_title_1","label":"Heading 1","default":"Zuverlässigkeit"},{"type":"textarea","id":"feature_copy_1","label":"Description 1","default":"Verlässliche Produkte und Prozesse für Ihren Alltag."},{"type":"color","id":"icon_bg_1","label":"Icon background 1","default":"#e8f4f5"},{"type":"color","id":"feature_title_color_1","label":"Heading color 1","default":"#1d2e40"},{"type":"color","id":"feature_copy_color_1","label":"Text color 1","default":"#44515f"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"icon_2","label":"Icon 2"},{"type":"text","id":"feature_title_2","label":"Heading 2","default":"Fachwissen"},{"type":"textarea","id":"feature_copy_2","label":"Description 2","default":"Kompetente Beratung für sichere Entscheidungen."},{"type":"color","id":"icon_bg_2","label":"Icon background 2","default":"#e8f4f5"},{"type":"color","id":"feature_title_color_2","label":"Heading color 2","default":"#1d2e40"},{"type":"color","id":"feature_copy_color_2","label":"Text color 2","default":"#44515f"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"icon_3","label":"Icon 3"},{"type":"text","id":"feature_title_3","label":"Heading 3","default":"Persönlicher Service"},{"type":"textarea","id":"feature_copy_3","label":"Description 3","default":"Wir sind für Sie da – vor, während und nach dem Kauf."},{"type":"color","id":"icon_bg_3","label":"Icon background 3","default":"#e8f4f5"},{"type":"color","id":"feature_title_color_3","label":"Heading color 3","default":"#1d2e40"},{"type":"color","id":"feature_copy_color_3","label":"Text color 3","default":"#44515f"}],"presets":[{"name":"Icon strengths"}],"tag":null,"class":"icon-strengths"}{% endschema %}